Cell["\<\
These  were most of the bck quantities at early times (all except k/a). Now \
before turning to k/a, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s compute background quantities \
at late times (during fast inflaton oscillations).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951218448999259*^9, 3.951218496645757*^9}, {
  3.999608644447863*^9, 
